000A67r 3               
000A67r 3               ; @label VGC.PAINT
000A67r 3               ; @kind routine
000A67r 3               ; @symbol vgc_paint
000A67r 3               ; @summary Issue the VGC paint command using VGC.P0..VGC.P3.
